---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Typography - Strata Features">
  <div class="container-custom">
    <div class="feature-page">
      <nav class="breadcrumb">
        <a href="/features">Features</a> / Typography
      </nav>

      <h1>Typography</h1>
      <p class="feature-intro">
        Text engine with rich text types, variable fonts, OpenType features, and multi-line layout.
      </p>

      <section class="feature-section">
        <h2>What It Is</h2>
        <p>
          Strata's typography system has a strong type foundation with rich text, character/paragraph styles, variable fonts, OpenType features, and text chains. The data model supports advanced typography features, though the rendering layer is still being strengthened.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="feature-section">
        <h2>Key Capabilities</h2>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Rich text data model:</strong> TextNode with richText, variableAxes, openTypeFeatures</li>
          <li><strong>Character styles:</strong> Font family, size, weight, line height, letter spacing</li>
          <li><strong>Paragraph styles:</strong> Alignment, vertical align, text direction, text wrap</li>
          <li><strong>Variable fonts:</strong> VariableFontSettings type declared (rendering in progress)</li>
          <li><strong>OpenType features:</strong> Feature tag support declared (rendering in progress)</li>
          <li><strong>Text chains:</strong> Path text settings declared (rendering in progress)</li>
          <li><strong>Typography inspector:</strong> F6 panel for text property editing</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="feature-section">
        <h2>Technical Depth</h2>
        <p>
          The typography system has a comprehensive type foundation in packages/scene/src/types.ts with TextNode supporting richText, variableAxes, openTypeFeatures, pathId, and pathTextSettings. The FontRegistry provides CSS-quoting and availability fixes. The engine IR has been extended for rich text, and Canvas2D replay rendering supports multi-line and rich text.
        </p>
        <p>
          SVG export includes multi-line and rich text support. Typography preflight has been strengthened with 14 tests covering font availability, CSS generation, and text measurement.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="feature-section">
        <h2>Limitations</h2>
        <div class="limitations">
          <p><strong>Current limitations:</strong></p>
          <ul>
            <li>Rich text, variable fonts, and OpenType features are declared but not fully rendered</li>
            <li>No inline text editor or text selection/caret</li>
            <li>No real text shaping (complex scripts, CJK, RTL, bidi not supported)</li>
            <li>Text flow chain rendering not implemented</li>
            <li>Document-wide typography styles not implemented</li>
            <li>Missing-glyph detection not implemented</li>
            <li>Quality bugs: invalid CSS from FontRegistry, incorrect letter-spacing/ellipsis overflow</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="feature-section">
        <h2>Status</h2>
        <div class="status-badge in-development">
          <span class="badge-text">In Development</span>
          <p>Strong type foundation with partial rendering. Typography execution layer is being strengthened.</p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <div class="feature-cta">
        <h2>Ready to design with type?</h2>
        <a href="/download" class="btn-primary">Download Strata</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .feature-page {
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 3rem 0;
  }
  
  .breadcrumb {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }
  
  .breadcrumb a {
    color: var(--color-neutral-600);
  }
  
  .feature-page h1 {
    font-size: 2.5rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    color: var(--color-neutral-900);
  }
  
  .feature-intro {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    color: var(--color-neutral-600);
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }
  
  .feature-section {
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }
  
  .feature-section h2 {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    color: var(--color-neutral-900);
  }
  
  .feature-section p {
    color: var(--color-neutral-600);
    line-height: 1.8;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  
  .feature-section ul {
    list-style: none;
  }
  
  .feature-section li {
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    padding-left: 1.5rem;
    position: relative;
    color: var(--color-neutral-600);
  }
  
  .feature-section li::before {
    content: "•";
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    color: var(--color-teal-400);
  }
  
  .feature-section strong {
    color: var(--color-neutral-900);
  }
  
  .limitations {
    background: var(--color-neutral-100);
    border-radius: 0.75rem;
    padding: 1.5rem;
  }
  
  .limitations p {
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  
  .status-badge {
    background: var(--color-sandstone-50);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-sandstone-400);
    border-radius: 0.75rem;
    padding: 1.5rem;
  }
  
  .status-badge.in-development {
    background: var(--color-sandstone-50);
    border-color: var(--color-sandstone-400);
  }
  
  .badge-text {
    display: inline-block;
    background: var(--color-sandstone-400);
    color: white;
    padding: 0.25rem 0.75rem;
    border-radius: 0.25rem;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }
  
  .status-badge p {
    color: var(--color-neutral-700);
    margin: 0;
  }
  
  .feature-cta {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 3rem 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-neutral-200);
  }
  
  .feature-cta h2 {
    font-size: 1.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    color: var(--color-neutral-900);
  }
</style>
